    {
      "id": "mzziat9wB5YMakUHlpceE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1137.587719612361,
      "y": 81.15485647292152,
      "width": 799.919677734375,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3q",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 438502121,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 704420201,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-01 | **Assigned-credential sign-in.** The\nsystem must allow Government Teachers,\nRural Teachers, Rural Students and technical\naccounts to sign in with assigned\ncredentials. Invalid credentials must be\nrejected without opening a user session. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-01 | **Assigned-credential sign-in.** The system must allow Government Teachers, Rural Teachers, Rural Students and technical accounts to sign in with assigned credentials. Invalid credentials must be rejected without opening a user session. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Y8wEZVJEKGjJAT5HJfUmg",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1129.6857420732986,
      "y": 338.65485647292155,
      "width": 784.11572265625,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1337048103,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1958923687,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-02 | **Role, assignment and enrollment\nauthorization.** The system must authorize\neach action and record according to the\nauthenticated role, assigned classroom and\nstudent enrollment. An unauthorized request\nmust be denied without returning protected\nacademic data. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-02 | **Role, assignment and enrollment authorization.** The system must authorize each action and record according to the authenticated role, assigned classroom and student enrollment. An unauthorized request must be denied without returning protected academic data. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "czYqsPlD2LhfwIb5kqODB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1115.9336973955642,
      "y": 663.6548564729216,
      "width": 756.6116333007812,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 175422921,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1205306441,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-03 | **Technical academic-structure\nconfiguration.** The system must allow a\ntechnical account to configure courses,\ngrades, classrooms, groups, enrollments and\nteacher assignments. Rural Teachers and\nRural Students must not receive this\ncapability. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-03 | **Technical academic-structure configuration.** The system must allow a technical account to configure courses, grades, classrooms, groups, enrollments and teacher assignments. Rural Teachers and Rural Students must not receive this capability. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "NvylebnHnUvoGm-NgjH_f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1133.8437620928298,
      "y": 1011.1548564729214,
      "width": 792.4317626953125,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 311795527,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1720221895,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-04 | **Minimum student roster for\nassigned teachers.** The system must show\na Rural Teacher the full name and enrollment\nidentifier of students in assigned classrooms\nwithout exposing an expanded student\nprofile. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-04 | **Minimum student roster for assigned teachers.** The system must show a Rural Teacher the full name and enrollment identifier of students in assigned classrooms without exposing an expanded student profile. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GO401HuCqApDZjZvQT7iE",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1119.4437376787673,
      "y": 1313.6548564729214,
      "width": 763.6317138671875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1116478633,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 80876329,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-05 | **Two-month package creation.**\nThe system must allow a Government\nTeacher to create an official material\npackage for one identified two-month\nacademic period. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-05 | **Two-month package creation.** The system must allow a Government Teacher to create an official material package for one identified two-month academic period. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d9dEb-IfAKlJupZb_3tc_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1126.7697874834548,
      "y": 1503.6548564729214,
      "width": 778.2838134765625,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 290463335,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 2003488743,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-06 | **Package assignment to\nconfigured destinations.** The system must\nallow a Government Teacher to associate a\npackage with preconfigured courses, grades,\nclassrooms, departments and schools. It\nmust reject an unknown or unauthorized\ndestination. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-06 | **Package assignment to configured destinations.** The system must allow a Government Teacher to associate a package with preconfigured courses, grades, classrooms, departments and schools. It must reject an unknown or unauthorized destination. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "STyQf4avq78R56M01ZDdF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1128.4797484209548,
      "y": 1828.6548564729214,
      "width": 781.7037353515625,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 34905993,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 626509321,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-07 | **Support for required educational\nfile types.** The system must accept PDFs,\ninformational documents, teacher guides,\ndigital books, worksheets, activities,\ninfographics, images and videos as package\nmaterial. An unsupported file must be\nrejected with an understandable reason. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-07 | **Support for required educational file types.** The system must accept PDFs, informational documents, teacher guides, digital books, worksheets, activities, infographics, images and videos as package material. An unsupported file must be rejected with an understandable reason. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yPqwdnDz4vVqWhx0ub56a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1117.355755501033,
      "y": 2176.1548564729214,
      "width": 759.4557495117188,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3x",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1320008071,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1366702855,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-08 | **Pre-publication file preview.**\nThe system must allow the Government\nTeacher to preview each supported file\nbefore publishing the package. A file that\ncannot be rendered must remain identifiable\nand downloadable for validation. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-08 | **Pre-publication file preview.** The system must allow the Government Teacher to preview each supported file before publishing the package. A file that cannot be rendered must remain identifiable and downloadable for validation. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "QK_81OFl4V4zNoxvcVQPk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1126.1937376787673,
      "y": 2456.1548564729214,
      "width": 777.1317138671875,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3y",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 122275433,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1415847145,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-09 | **AI-assisted material creation.**\nThe system must provide Government\nTeachers with an AI assistant for creating\nor improving educational material. Failure of\nthe assistant must not prevent manual file\nupload. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-09 | **AI-assisted material creation.** The system must provide Government Teachers with an AI assistant for creating or improving educational material. Failure of the assistant must not prevent manual file upload. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "fpJTD7GwA2nsNcpaYoe9a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1112.7657591631423,
      "y": 2758.6548564729214,
      "width": 750.2757568359375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1072361639,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 690438695,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-10 | **AI skill selection.** The AI\nassistant must select the configured skills\nrelevant to the requested material and\nrecord which skills were used for the\ngeneration. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-10 | **AI skill selection.** The AI assistant must select the configured skills relevant to the requested material and record which skills were used for the generation. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "um4y6bZsNXTzzVEWtzP9N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1130.9997069170486,
      "y": 3016.1548564729214,
      "width": 786.74365234375,
      "height": 180,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b40",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1022824777,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1367513033,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-11 | **AI model selection.** The system\nmust select an appropriate enabled AI model\nfor the request and record the selected\nmodel with its token usage. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-11 | **AI model selection.** The system must select an appropriate enabled AI model for the request and record the selected model with its token usage. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Ocs8_jClQ8dIaus3YIEIj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1115.753735237361,
      "y": 3183.6548564729214,
      "width": 756.251708984375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b41",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2125743047,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1869243719,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-12 | **Configurable AI-token limits.**\nThe system must enforce configured token\nlimits by Government Teacher, day and\ncourse. The active limits must be visible\nbefore a new generation begins. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-12 | **Configurable AI-token limits.** The system must enforce configured token limits by Government Teacher, day and course. The active limits must be visible before a new generation begins. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "osza1I8NJ4vXd2x2RsgCt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1127.273754768611,
      "y": 3396.1548564729214,
      "width": 779.291748046875,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b42",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 678953001,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1590605481,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-13 | **AI limit enforcement and\nexplanation.** When a token limit is reached,\nthe system must block further generation\nunder that limit and show the affected limit\nand recorded consumption. Manual content\nwork must remain available. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-13 | **AI limit enforcement and explanation.** When a token limit is reached, the system must block further generation under that limit and show the affected limit and recorded consumption. Manual content work must remain available. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "eySn2Q963jg1vmmWns1d5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1123.6737791826736,
      "y": 3676.1548564729214,
      "width": 772.091796875,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b43",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 992359143,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1134306407,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-14 | **Versioned package publication.**\nThe system must publish a package with its\nacademic period, version number and file\nmanifest. Publication must preserve the\nidentity of the Government Teacher who\nperformed it. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-14 | **Versioned package publication.** The system must publish a package with its academic period, version number and file manifest. Publication must preserve the identity of the Government Teacher who performed it. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a1v3jOVEaLziLC5_tlMSe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1118.3097349932204,
      "y": 3978.6548564729214,
      "width": 761.3637084960938,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b44",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 397939465,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1861482889,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-15 | **Non-destructive package\ncorrection.** A correction to published\nmaterial must create a new package version\nwithout overwriting the version currently\nactive at a school. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-15 | **Non-destructive package correction.** A correction to published material must create a new package version without overwriting the version currently active at a school. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "vo-SgsXSzmwurqm_p4gKx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1122.5397764971267,
      "y": 4191.154856472922,
      "width": 769.8237915039062,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b45",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1842167303,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 629735303,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-16 | **Destination distribution\nstatus.** The system must show the\nGovernment Teacher each version's status\nby department and school using the defined\nsynchronization states and an actionable\nreason for failure. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-16 | **Destination distribution status.** The system must show the Government Teacher each version's status by department and school using the defined synchronization states and an actionable reason for failure. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IXJ26ln8b8ABlToE66Ppx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1130.7657286455642,
      "y": 4493.654856472922,
      "width": 786.2756958007812,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b46",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 254986729,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 321773673,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-17 | **Hierarchical package\ndistribution.** The system must transfer\neach published package from Lima through\nthe cloud and target departmental server to\neach target school server. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-17 | **Hierarchical package distribution.** The system must transfer each published package from Lima through the cloud and target departmental server to each target school server. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "DYdZuxd5FXau5heqOX4CX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1126.481732063533,
      "y": 4728.654856472922,
      "width": 777.7077026367188,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b47",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1235608871,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1735227047,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-18 | **End-to-end version and manifest\npreservation.** Every distribution level must\npreserve the package version identity and\nfile manifest received from the preceding\nlevel. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-18 | **End-to-end version and manifest preservation.** Every distribution level must preserve the package version identity and file manifest received from the preceding level. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "yDDaF7yfwizm2nJpuyGX_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1116.1137511065017,
      "y": 4963.654856472922,
      "width": 756.9717407226562,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b48",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2012456137,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 692579145,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-19 | **Automatic large-file retry or\nresume.** If a large-file transfer is\ninterrupted, the system must automatically\nretry or resume it without requiring the\nentire package to restart manually. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-19 | **Automatic large-file retry or resume.** If a large-file transfer is interrupted, the system must automatically retry or resume it without requiring the entire package to restart manually. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mQhCnfj_Cu9F9H4X0fQUR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1131.773754768611,
      "y": 5176.154856472922,
      "width": 788.291748046875,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b49",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1847371847,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1609959879,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-20 | **School-side file-integrity\nverification.** The school server must verify\nevery received file against the package\nmanifest before marking it as complete. A\nmismatch must identify the file that requires\nanother transfer. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-20 | **School-side file-integrity verification.** The school server must verify every received file against the package manifest before marking it as complete. A mismatch must identify the file that requires another transfer. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "IsQtdOgffBrnlPyf2m1uA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1128.9477049639236,
      "y": 5478.654856472922,
      "width": 782.6396484375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 227943337,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1235065385,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-21 | **Complete-version activation.**\nThe school server must activate a new\nversion only after every file passes integrity\nverification. Activation must make that one\nversion available as the current package. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-21 | **Complete-version activation.** The school server must activate a new version only after every file passes integrity verification. Activation must make that one version available as the current package. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "3joErmSiFhFjBLi-c-hYh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1129.5597044756423,
      "y": 5713.654856472922,
      "width": 783.8636474609375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1494091623,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1547647207,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-22 | **Previous-version fallback.** If a\nreplacement version is incomplete or fails\nverification, the school server must continue\nserving the previous active version and\nreport the failed replacement. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-22 | **Previous-version fallback.** If a replacement version is incomplete or fails verification, the school server must continue serving the previous active version and report the failed replacement. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2YBl512ZFozLAU6a5ODi0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1123.2597166826736,
      "y": 5926.154856472922,
      "width": 771.263671875,
      "height": 270,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 205899401,
      "version": 55,
      "versionNonce": 1964666121,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-23 | **Confirmed temporary-cache\ncleanup.** The system must delete transfer\nchunks and transient copies only after\nsynchronization and integrity are confirmed.\nIt must not delete the active package as\npart of this cleanup. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-23 | **Confirmed temporary-cache cleanup.** The system must delete transfer chunks and transient copies only after synchronization and integrity are confirmed. It must not delete the active package as part of this cleanup. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "p5siIOmpFfUpQn1SL2oPz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1134.4557616045486,
      "y": 6228.654856472922,
      "width": 793.65576171875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
