      "text": "| FR-24 | **Assigned active-package view for\nRural Teachers.** The system must show\neach Rural Teacher the current period and\nactive package for assigned courses and\nclassrooms. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-24 | **Assigned active-package view for Rural Teachers.** The system must show each Rural Teacher the current period and active package for assigned courses and classrooms. |",
