      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-25 | **LAN-based teacher material\nuse.** A Rural Teacher must be able to view,\ndownload, play and print active material over\nthe school LAN without external internet\naccess. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
