      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-27 | **Classroom task creation.** A\nRural Teacher must be able to create a task\nfor an assigned classroom with instructions,\nattachments, a publication time and a due\ndate. |",
