      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-29 | **Scheduled task and\nannouncement publication.** A Rural Teacher\nmust be able to publish a task or\nannouncement immediately or schedule its\npublication for an assigned classroom. |",
