      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-29 | **Scheduled task and announcement publication.** A Rural Teacher must be able to publish a task or announcement immediately or schedule its publication for an assigned classroom. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
