      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-31 | **Submission and activity grading.**\nA Rural Teacher must be able to assign a\ngrade to a student submission or evaluated\nactivity in an assigned classroom. |",
