      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| FR-31 | **Submission and activity grading.** A Rural Teacher must be able to assign a grade to a student submission or evaluated activity in an assigned classroom. |",
