      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788744148650,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| FR-35 | **Enrollment-filtered Rural Student\nhome.** The system must show a Rural\nStudent only the courses, material, tasks\nand announcements associated with the\ncurrent enrollment and classroom. |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
