      "originalText": "| FR-35 | **Enrollment-filtered Rural Student home.** The system must show a Rural Student only the courses, material, tasks and announcements associated with the current enrollment and classroom. |",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
